WEBVTT

00:06.840 --> 00:10.650
Breakfast is even more delicious 
after sleeping in until the afternoon!

00:11.010 --> 00:16.100
I hunted golems all day yesterday. 
I deserve this much.

00:17.220 --> 00:18.450
Now, then.

00:18.450 --> 00:21.450
<b>Sender: God</b>

00:18.450 --> 00:21.450
<b>Dear Yuna,
 Are you working hard at adventuring?
I prepared a present for you today.
I forgot to tell you that I'll prepare all sorts of
 presents every once in a while, so try to find them.</b>

00:18.450 --> 00:22.790
<i>The present from God that 
the mithril golem was protecting...</i>

00:22.790 --> 00:24.290
<i>If this stuff...</i>

00:25.210 --> 00:26.530
That's great.

00:26.530 --> 00:28.730
Oh, Yuna! We're back!

00:28.730 --> 00:30.630
That was fast. Isn't it only mid-afternoon?

00:30.630 --> 00:32.670
It was just like you said.

00:32.670 --> 00:36.470
We went through the entire cave, 
but there wasn't a single golem left.

00:36.810 --> 00:38.940
That's why we were able to 
come back so fast.

00:38.940 --> 00:40.520
I still can't believe it...

00:40.520 --> 00:44.020
This pet of yours really hunted 
all of them down alone?

00:44.340 --> 00:47.730
<i>I should let Bozo Red eat 
a little more electricity.</i>

00:47.730 --> 00:53.990
Jeez. Didn't Yuna show you 
enough proof yesterday?

00:55.220 --> 00:58.200
Fine, I can acknowledge her strength.

00:58.200 --> 01:01.110
But why did the golems 
suddenly stop spawning?!

01:01.110 --> 01:05.790
The only possibility I can think of is 
that the mithril golem was spawning them.

01:06.740 --> 01:09.270
I still wanted to rake in more money...

01:09.270 --> 01:11.320
Let's drink today! Damn it!

01:11.320 --> 01:12.720
Time to drink!

01:12.720 --> 01:17.710
<i>Just like I thought, did God's 
present cause all of this?</i>

01:18.830 --> 01:21.050
<i>Right. I'll keep this a secret for life.</i>

03:02.910 --> 03:07.370
I've been wanting to do this 
since I saw them in Crimonia!

03:07.370 --> 03:09.830
So fluffy...

03:09.830 --> 03:12.290
H-Hey! Me, too!

03:12.950 --> 03:15.780
Is it really okay to go back first?

03:15.780 --> 03:20.510
You did all the hard work, 
we'll take care of the rest.

03:20.510 --> 03:23.840
Just make sure to report to the 
adventurer's guild in the royal capital.

03:23.840 --> 03:27.860
Okay. Then, I'll head back first.

03:27.860 --> 03:28.810
Hey, pet!

03:28.810 --> 03:30.840
No, your name was Yuna.

03:30.840 --> 03:35.450
If you beg, I might let you join my party.

03:35.450 --> 03:37.520
You really never learn...

03:39.410 --> 03:41.450
The powerful crimson blade, Bozo Red!

03:41.450 --> 03:43.530
The azure shooting spear, Bozo Blue!

03:43.530 --> 03:45.900
The explosive verdant arm, Bozo Green!

03:45.900 --> 03:48.050
The dark gale, Bozo Black!

03:48.050 --> 03:50.580
The healing of alabastrine, Bozo White!

03:50.580 --> 03:53.350
The ursid roar, Bozo Bear!

03:53.350 --> 03:57.800
We are the adventuring party, Bozo Rangers!

03:57.800 --> 03:59.570
Anything but that.

03:59.570 --> 04:00.350
Why?!

04:00.350 --> 04:02.700
No, normal people wouldn't want to join.

04:02.700 --> 04:03.490
I wouldn't.

04:03.490 --> 04:04.010
Nope.

04:04.010 --> 04:04.840
Not me.

04:07.530 --> 04:09.350
Why?!

04:09.350 --> 04:11.550
See you later, Yuna.

04:16.510 --> 04:20.030
Okay, Kumayuru. You'll be leading 
the way until Kumakyu's turn.

04:21.490 --> 04:23.470
I've obtained the mithril.

04:23.470 --> 04:26.260
It's time to save my princess!

04:26.260 --> 04:27.570
Just kidding.

04:30.750 --> 04:35.450
If the golems have stopped spawning, 
we won't have to ask the country to intervene.

04:35.450 --> 04:36.960
Thank you, Yuna.

04:37.580 --> 04:40.130
All I did was finish the job I took.

04:40.130 --> 04:43.100
And you did it perfectly.

04:43.100 --> 04:44.990
Unfortunately, I can't give you 
your share of the reward

04:44.990 --> 04:47.720
until I receive Jaden's confirmation report.

04:48.090 --> 04:52.240
Does that mean I need to stay in 
the royal capital to get the reward?

04:52.240 --> 04:53.200
Don't worry.

04:53.200 --> 04:58.270
You'll be able to collect the reward at 
the adventurer's guild in Crimonia, too.

04:58.610 --> 05:02.860
Of course, personally, I wish 
you'd stay in the capital...

05:04.820 --> 05:07.530
Well, I'll come over to play 
every once in a while.

05:10.870 --> 05:13.450
Welcome back, Lady Yuna.

05:13.450 --> 05:17.440
Oh, uh, th-thanks for helping me.

05:17.440 --> 05:18.790
Yuna Sis!

05:25.220 --> 05:27.180
Fina, I'm back!

05:43.210 --> 05:45.830
Fina, you look really cute.

05:48.390 --> 05:54.980
I don't want to hear that from someone 
who's always wearing a cute bear suit.

05:54.980 --> 05:57.150
Huh? Are you mad about something?

05:57.150 --> 05:58.750
It was really serious.

05:58.750 --> 06:02.140
They made me wear all sorts 
of pretty clothes, meet the king,

06:02.140 --> 06:07.050
take a bath with Lady Shia, and 
Ms. Surilina even did everything for me!

06:07.050 --> 06:09.760
<i>That actually sounds pretty rough.</i>

06:09.760 --> 06:10.950
Um...

06:10.950 --> 06:13.610
Sorry for leaving you all alone!

06:15.340 --> 06:17.740
I understand, since it was for work.

06:17.740 --> 06:21.440
Everyone was very kind!

06:21.950 --> 06:26.480
But the thought of making a mistake 
made my stomach hurt...

06:27.380 --> 06:28.150
Yeah.

06:32.690 --> 06:34.760
Welcome back, Yuna.

06:34.760 --> 06:36.970
What did you all do to Fina?

06:36.970 --> 06:39.520
Well, Fina is just too cute!

06:39.520 --> 06:44.440
It was like I got another little sister, 
and I wanted to treat her well.

06:44.440 --> 06:47.670
Lady Fina is very enjoyable to serve.

06:49.010 --> 06:51.080
Are you going to return home already?

06:51.080 --> 06:55.770
Yeah, I have to return Fina 
to her parents soon.

06:56.350 --> 07:00.190
Please come by our home again 
the next time you visit the royal capital!

07:00.190 --> 07:02.210
Yeah, next time I'll...

07:00.890 --> 07:02.210
You as well, Fina!

07:02.210 --> 07:03.440
H-Huh?!

07:03.440 --> 07:07.650
Th-Thank you for taking care of me, Lady Shia!

07:07.650 --> 07:08.820
Yuna.

07:10.020 --> 07:12.430
This is a separate reward from me.

07:12.430 --> 07:13.280
What?

07:13.280 --> 07:15.060
It's such a nice knife.

07:15.490 --> 07:19.300
This Foschurose crest signifies 
that the owner of this knife

07:19.300 --> 07:21.460
is backed by the Foschurose family.

07:21.790 --> 07:26.450
Don't hesitate to show this to others if you 
get involved in any troublesome matters.

07:26.450 --> 07:28.670
I see. Just like in <i>Mito Komon</i>.

07:30.040 --> 07:33.210
"Do you not see the crest 
on this medicine case?!"

07:33.210 --> 07:34.580
Like that.

07:36.560 --> 07:38.490
Me-toe Co-mon?

07:38.490 --> 07:39.770
Medicine case?

07:39.770 --> 07:40.930
Are you sure?

07:40.930 --> 07:45.730
I might use the power of nobles 
for evil, you know?

07:47.180 --> 07:49.290
Goodness, Yuna.

07:50.290 --> 07:52.090
Hey! Stop!

07:52.090 --> 07:56.230
Hey, Fina. Does Yuna look like 
that kind of a bad person?

07:56.230 --> 07:59.790
No, Yuna Sis is a very kind and good person!

07:59.790 --> 08:03.540
My mother and I wouldn't be here 
without Yuna Sis!

08:03.540 --> 08:05.980
Dad wouldn't have married Mom

08:05.980 --> 08:09.520
and the children of the orphanage 
wouldn't smile like they do now!

08:09.520 --> 08:13.410
Yuna Sis is so kind and strong 
that she'd never do anything bad!

08:13.410 --> 08:14.440
On top of that!

08:16.510 --> 08:18.970
Fina, that's enough.

08:24.700 --> 08:29.110
I can't believe you defeated 
and brought me a mithril golem.

08:29.110 --> 08:31.090
Can you make a knife with this?

08:31.090 --> 08:32.150
Of course.

08:32.150 --> 08:35.350
You wanted a harvesting knife 
for the little girl there, right?

08:35.700 --> 08:38.640
I'll have Mister Gold make Fina's knife.

08:38.640 --> 08:42.080
Can you make me two battle 
knives with this, Mr. Ghazal?

08:42.080 --> 08:43.420
For you?

08:43.420 --> 08:45.290
And two of them?

08:46.060 --> 08:46.790
For dual wielding?

08:46.790 --> 08:48.000
Yeah.

08:48.000 --> 08:52.780
<i>Any gamer would admire 
Ms. Senia's cool fighting style!</i>

08:55.050 --> 08:57.560
It takes a while to make 
something with mithril,

08:57.560 --> 08:59.970
so it's a good idea to split up the work.

08:59.970 --> 09:02.890
I'm taking enough material for the two knives.

09:04.230 --> 09:05.830
I'll give you back anything I don't use.

09:05.830 --> 09:07.190
Wow! Amazing!

09:07.660 --> 09:09.400
Oh, that's right.

09:09.400 --> 09:11.550
Mister Ghazal, do you know 
anything about this stone?

09:13.650 --> 09:15.980
Lemme take a look.

09:17.230 --> 09:21.300
All I can tell is that it's definitely 
not a normal stone.

09:21.300 --> 09:23.830
My master might know something about it.

09:23.830 --> 09:25.540
Your master?

09:25.540 --> 09:27.350
My master lives in the dwarven city.

09:27.350 --> 09:30.460
It's pretty far, so it's 
not easy to go and visit.

09:30.460 --> 09:32.030
The dwarven city!

09:32.030 --> 09:34.040
<i>A must-have in any fantasy!</i>

09:34.040 --> 09:36.000
A dwarven city?! I definitely wanna go!

09:36.000 --> 09:36.670
Th-That so?

09:36.670 --> 09:40.100
If you want to go, I can write a letter 
of introduction to my master for you.

09:40.100 --> 09:42.070
Yeah! Thank you!

09:43.060 --> 09:48.300
<i>This world just keeps getting bigger. 
Is this another present from God?</i>

09:48.670 --> 09:50.400
What kind of sham is this?!

09:50.400 --> 09:51.980
Sham?

09:51.980 --> 09:53.980
See the difference in color here?

09:53.980 --> 09:56.700
The outside is mithril, 
but it's actually lined with iron.

09:56.700 --> 09:57.320
Iron?

09:57.320 --> 10:01.780
There's enough here to make your knives, 
but you can't help calling this a sham.

10:01.780 --> 10:04.620
<i>God, you're pretty stingy...</i>

10:07.530 --> 10:08.250
Huh?

10:08.250 --> 10:11.440
This isn't the way to your house 
in the royal capital, is it?

10:11.440 --> 10:14.120
I'm going to check on Ms. Morin's shop.

10:14.120 --> 10:17.500
She might go back someday, 
so it should be taken care of.

10:18.260 --> 10:20.840
There's someone sitting 
in front of the shop.

10:21.610 --> 10:24.680
What's wrong? This shop here closed down.

10:25.640 --> 10:28.190
Huh?! A b-bear?

10:28.190 --> 10:31.580
No, a girl has been 
swallowed whole by a bear?!

10:31.580 --> 10:34.050
That was an unexpected reaction.

10:35.420 --> 10:37.440
I'm sorry for jumping to conclusions!

10:37.440 --> 10:41.140
I came to visit my relatives in the royal 
capital, but their shop closed down...

10:41.140 --> 10:43.910
I heard they ran in the middle 
of the night to escape their debt...

10:43.910 --> 10:45.880
<i>Huh? Does that mean...</i>

10:46.630 --> 10:49.750
Auntie Morin, Cousin Karin, where did you go?

10:50.550 --> 10:51.830
<i>Right.</i>

10:52.210 --> 10:54.120
Do you know Ms. Morin?

10:54.120 --> 10:55.740
Do you two know them?!

10:55.740 --> 11:00.890
Of course I do. They opened a shop 
in my hometown, Crimonia.

11:00.890 --> 11:04.180
They're no longer in debt, 
and they're not on the run.

11:04.550 --> 11:06.140
Is that true?

11:06.140 --> 11:10.980
Yes. They bake delicious bread 
that makes everyone happy every day.

11:12.020 --> 11:14.890
Thank goodness. So, they're both safe.

11:14.890 --> 11:16.570
Oh, my name is Nerin.

11:16.570 --> 11:19.630
Auntie Morin is my father's little sister.

11:19.630 --> 11:20.900
I'm Yuna.

11:20.900 --> 11:21.700
I'm Fina.

11:22.100 --> 11:24.550
You didn't hear anything from Ms. Morin?

11:24.550 --> 11:25.390
I haven't.

11:25.390 --> 11:28.410
I wish they at least sent us a letter!

11:28.410 --> 11:31.000
So, they're in Crimonia now?

11:31.000 --> 11:34.000
I want to see them,
but I've run out of money.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.130
What should I do?

11:35.130 --> 11:36.610
Yuna Sis...

11:38.610 --> 11:42.430
This should be enough to 
ride the carriage to Crimonia.

11:42.430 --> 11:43.090
Huh?

11:43.090 --> 11:44.790
Wait, money?!

11:44.790 --> 11:47.690
Ms. Morin has done a lot for me in Crimonia.

11:47.690 --> 11:48.720
But...

11:48.720 --> 11:54.920
If I leave you here and something happens 
to you, I won't be able to face Ms. Morin.

11:54.920 --> 11:56.150
Miss Yuna...

11:59.690 --> 12:02.530
Thank you. I'll definitely pay you back.

12:02.910 --> 12:07.450
Ms. Morin is working at 
a bakery called Bear Haven.

12:07.450 --> 12:09.340
You'll be able to meet her there.

12:09.340 --> 12:10.450
Bear...

12:10.960 --> 12:12.890
Okay. Got it!

12:16.370 --> 12:20.140
Why didn't you tell her Ms. Morin 
is working in your shop?

12:20.140 --> 12:22.590
I thought it'd be more interesting this way.

12:22.590 --> 12:24.970
Yuna Sis, that's mean...

12:25.280 --> 12:29.800
Welp. A lot of things happened, 
but we should go back, too.

12:35.730 --> 12:37.520
Thanks for the meal!

12:38.590 --> 12:43.270
Was Ms. Tiermina angry that 
I took you out for so long?

12:43.270 --> 12:45.860
No, she wasn't worried at all.

12:45.860 --> 12:49.690
We're going to Mr. Gold's place today, right?

12:49.690 --> 12:50.690
That's right.

12:50.690 --> 12:54.030
Yuna Sis, can I go, too?

12:54.590 --> 12:57.990
Shuri, you're interested 
in harvesting monsters, right?

12:58.670 --> 13:04.250
If you plan to learn, I want to 
give you a useful tool as a present.

13:04.250 --> 13:04.880
Yeah!

13:05.290 --> 13:07.240
I want to help my sister!

13:07.240 --> 13:08.970
Thank you, Yuna Sis!

13:08.970 --> 13:10.880
Yay!

13:12.380 --> 13:14.350
I can't wait!

13:13.090 --> 13:14.350
Yuna Sis.

13:15.940 --> 13:16.810
Huh?!

13:19.270 --> 13:21.480
F-Fina?

13:21.940 --> 13:23.190
Sis?

13:25.400 --> 13:26.960
Sit down.

13:26.960 --> 13:28.870
Huh? I'm already sitting?

13:28.870 --> 13:30.330
Sit.

13:30.330 --> 13:31.450
Yes.

13:36.210 --> 13:39.010
What's wrong with your head, Yuna Sis?!

13:39.010 --> 13:41.880
A single mithril knife 
is already a super big deal

13:41.880 --> 13:43.550
and now you plan to give one to Shuri, too?!

13:43.550 --> 13:46.310
Huh? What? Why're you mad?

13:46.310 --> 13:51.580
Goodness. I've always thought that 
your sense of money is wrong, Yuna Sis!

13:51.580 --> 13:54.860
You don't understand just how 
expensive a mithril knife is!

13:54.860 --> 13:55.690
Huh?!

13:55.690 --> 13:58.730
Sis, are mithril knives really that expensive?

13:58.730 --> 14:05.450
Mom and Dad would have to work 
really hard, every day, for months,

14:05.450 --> 14:06.820
to save up for one!

14:07.980 --> 14:11.570
Yuna Sis, I don't need a knife.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.790
You're right.

14:15.790 --> 14:18.460
Since I shouldn't give Shuri a mithril knife,

14:18.800 --> 14:21.180
how about lending her one?

14:22.260 --> 14:24.080
You don't understand at all!

14:24.080 --> 14:25.880
I'm so sorry!

14:26.210 --> 14:31.180
<b>Bear, Getting Lectured</b>

14:26.210 --> 14:31.180
<b>Bear, Getting Lectured</b>

14:26.260 --> 14:27.210
Welcome!

14:27.210 --> 14:28.380
Our prices are cheap!

14:28.380 --> 14:30.400
Buy 'em while you can!

14:34.720 --> 14:35.730
Please give me this!

14:35.730 --> 14:37.790
What about this one?

14:37.790 --> 14:39.140
Thanks!

14:40.640 --> 14:47.840
<i>Thank goodness I managed to calm Fina down 
and order an extra mithril knife for Shuri.</i>

14:47.840 --> 14:51.280
<i>But Fina is pretty scary when she's mad.</i>

14:51.280 --> 14:55.600
<i>And it hurts to have my common sense 
questioned by someone younger than me.</i>

14:57.350 --> 14:59.080
At times like this...

15:01.830 --> 15:04.200
<i>That's it!</i>

15:04.570 --> 15:06.490
I've reflected on my actions.

15:07.260 --> 15:10.660
Lately, I've been upsetting Fina a lot.

15:10.660 --> 15:12.680
I have to regain my honor!

15:12.680 --> 15:16.390
I'd even sell my soul to the devil to do it!

15:17.840 --> 15:20.890
This will be the key to victory!

15:22.370 --> 15:25.750
I thought it was a divine revelation 
when I saw these in the market.

15:25.750 --> 15:27.450
I can make <i>it</i> if I have these.

15:27.450 --> 15:30.320
The devil's dessert that all the women 
in the world go crazy for...

15:30.940 --> 15:32.530
Strawberry shortcake!

15:34.870 --> 15:37.830
It's just that I don't remember 
exactly how to make it.

15:37.830 --> 15:39.920
You two need to be my taste testers.

15:41.070 --> 15:44.420
You'll be able to eat more 
in your larger form.

15:44.420 --> 15:47.380
Well, you might get fat if you eat too much.

15:49.780 --> 15:51.170
I'll eat, too!

15:51.580 --> 15:54.900
It's okay! No one will notice 
if I gain some weight in my bear suit.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.080
No!

15:59.080 --> 16:02.320
This sponge cake can't handle the sweetness 
of the strawberries and whipped cream!

16:02.320 --> 16:03.540
Again!

16:07.080 --> 16:10.450
The texture and sweetness of this 
whipped cream is too far from ideal!

16:10.450 --> 16:12.610
I'll make it again after we eat it all!

16:14.090 --> 16:16.460
My mouth can't handle all this sweetness!

16:16.460 --> 16:19.210
I want to eat some rice crackers! 
I want to go to Wa!

16:26.150 --> 16:27.090
Hello...

16:27.090 --> 16:30.010
Yuna Sis, you seem a bit down?

16:30.010 --> 16:32.630
Kumayuru and Kumakyu, too.

16:35.190 --> 16:37.850
That's not true. We're feeling great!

16:38.120 --> 16:40.080
I'm glad to hear that.

16:41.400 --> 16:44.310
Yuna Sis, I'm sorry.

16:45.310 --> 16:47.720
I said too much last time.

16:47.720 --> 16:52.850
You always think of us and 
take such good care of us!

16:57.740 --> 16:59.580
You weren't in the wrong, Fina.

16:59.580 --> 17:04.330
I'm thankful that you honestly 
pointed out my strange way of thinking.

17:07.750 --> 17:11.340
And so, I made something 
as both an apology and thanks.

17:12.900 --> 17:14.080
Wh-What's this?!

17:14.080 --> 17:15.550
It's so white and pretty!

17:16.510 --> 17:18.340
This is strawberry shortcake.

17:18.340 --> 17:19.800
It's sweet and delicious.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.770
Now, enjoy.

17:31.940 --> 17:33.650
Delicious!

17:33.650 --> 17:35.440
What is this white stuff?

17:35.440 --> 17:39.860
It looks like a cloud, but it's fluffy 
and sweet and so... so...!

17:39.860 --> 17:41.500
It's whipped cream.

17:41.500 --> 17:45.290
It's made from cow's milk. You can 
use it in all sorts of sweets.

17:46.050 --> 17:48.920
The sweet and sour strawberries are so tasty!

17:50.260 --> 17:52.670
I love it. I'm so happy.

17:52.670 --> 17:55.130
There's plenty, so eat as much as you like.

17:55.130 --> 17:56.560
Yay!

17:56.560 --> 17:58.810
By the way, why'd you visit today?

17:58.810 --> 18:02.180
Huh? Aren't we picking up 
the mithril knives today?

18:02.180 --> 18:04.720
Oh. I was busy making cakes and forgot.

18:05.030 --> 18:07.150
Jeez, Yuna Sis...

18:07.150 --> 18:08.620
Sorry. Sorry.

18:08.620 --> 18:14.320
After we finish eating, let's go get the
 knives and harvest the black tiger.

18:14.320 --> 18:15.410
Yeah!

18:15.880 --> 18:20.410
Actually, Dad wanted to ask you about that.

18:22.750 --> 18:25.030
Sorry for troubling you, Yuna.

18:25.030 --> 18:26.370
I don't mind at all.

18:26.370 --> 18:29.080
Why did you want her to 
harvest it at the guild?

18:29.560 --> 18:31.590
It's a direct request from the guild.

18:31.590 --> 18:32.840
Miss Helen?

18:33.420 --> 18:37.400
The golem quest has concluded after confirming
 that the golems have stopped spawning.

18:37.400 --> 18:39.290
This is your reward.

18:39.290 --> 18:40.180
Thanks.

18:40.180 --> 18:42.790
Now, about this.

18:42.790 --> 18:46.520
It's really rare for the parts 
of a black tiger to be harvested.

18:46.520 --> 18:49.520
We wanted the staff to study the process.

18:50.700 --> 18:52.610
Be more aware of yourself.

18:52.610 --> 18:54.820
Who knows what you'll bring in next time?

18:56.590 --> 18:58.950
Okay. Let's get started, Fina.

19:00.040 --> 19:02.600
Don't worry, I'll help 
if you have any problems.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.740
Yes, Dad.

19:05.370 --> 19:07.410
Do your best, Sis!

19:07.410 --> 19:08.580
You can do it, Fina.

19:08.930 --> 19:11.290
Yeah. Just watch.

19:19.800 --> 19:21.130
All right! It cut through!

19:28.520 --> 19:31.620
As expected of mithril. So sharp!

19:31.620 --> 19:36.610
Yeah. The sharpness of mithril 
is impressive, but that's not all.

19:36.610 --> 19:41.320
Even with a good knife, you can't 
cut things without the proper skill.

19:42.700 --> 19:46.040
Having a mithril weapon doesn't mean 
you can cut down an iron golem.

19:46.040 --> 19:48.760
Jaden and Senia can do it because 
they have the skills to back it up.

19:51.840 --> 19:54.380
Seriously. She's grown so much!

20:00.840 --> 20:03.180
She's my partner, after all.

20:03.180 --> 20:06.620
Of course she'd be able to 
handle a mithril knife.

20:10.700 --> 20:12.630
Thank you, Yuna Sis!

20:12.630 --> 20:15.470
I'll keep harvesting everything you hunt!

20:15.470 --> 20:18.690
Whether it's a black viper, 
a kraken, or even a dragon!

20:18.690 --> 20:21.250
What a dependable partner.

20:22.030 --> 20:24.550
Me, too! I'll help, too!

20:25.340 --> 20:26.860
Sounds like fun!

20:26.860 --> 20:27.680
Huh?

20:30.550 --> 20:34.540
Yuna, do you understand how 
valuable mithril knives are?

20:34.980 --> 20:39.380
Yes. Your daughter gave me 
a thorough explanation.

20:39.380 --> 20:44.440
I can, barely, accept Fina getting 
a knife since she needs it for work.

20:44.440 --> 20:47.620
But does Shuri really need 
something this valuable?

20:47.620 --> 20:50.770
Your daughter has also lectured me about that.

20:50.770 --> 20:57.480
It will be stored in my house and only used 
with a proper supervisor when needed.

20:57.870 --> 20:59.400
Yeah! Yeah!

21:00.850 --> 21:02.110
Goodness...

21:02.620 --> 21:05.170
I wish you discussed this with me first.

21:05.170 --> 21:07.250
I am deeply sorry for my actions.

21:07.250 --> 21:12.830
Um, I don't know if it'll suit your taste, 
but please quell your anger with this.

21:13.190 --> 21:17.470
Yuna, are you trying to 
win me over with food?

21:18.570 --> 21:21.260
It's sweet! This is so sweet!

21:22.170 --> 21:26.940
I just can't stop eating! Goodness 
gracious! You're so sly, Yuna!

21:26.940 --> 21:29.880
Now I can't stay angry! 
Because it's so sweet!

21:29.880 --> 21:30.510
Yes!

21:30.510 --> 21:32.580
Hey, what about my share?

21:32.580 --> 21:34.860
Huh? An old man like you eats cake?

21:34.860 --> 21:36.850
That's discrimination!

21:36.850 --> 21:39.180
Old men like sweets, too!

21:39.990 --> 21:41.760
Even if you ask for some...

21:42.680 --> 21:45.620
Uh, I'll make some for you next time, okay?

21:45.960 --> 21:50.500
This shortcake... We should 
sell it as a new menu item!

21:50.500 --> 21:51.330
Huh?!

21:51.330 --> 21:54.360
We can eat it again?! All right!

21:54.360 --> 21:55.540
Yay!

21:56.610 --> 21:57.540
That's great!

21:57.540 --> 22:01.720
<i>I can't believe it. 
It really is the devil's dessert.</i>

22:01.720 --> 22:03.930
<i>Fear the strawberry shortcake!</i>

23:35.470 --> 23:40.060
<b>Bear, Studying Black Tea</b>

23:35.510 --> 23:40.060
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.790 --> 23:37.500
Bear!
